    "updated_at": "2026-06-05T21:55:45Z",
    "body": "Update: further testing reproduced the bug on B200 (SM100) as well, with the v0.21.0 prebuilt wheel + torch 2.11.0 under default cudagraph mode (QuIP variants: garbage PPL ~1.4e6; coherent with `enforce_eager=True`). So this is not SM120-specific: the trigger is the (torch version x compile/cudagraph) combination, not the hardware. Anyone serving transform-quantized models on Blackwell with the released wheel is affected. Details and numbers added to the PR description and test table.\r\n\r\nBranch is rebased on latest main, DCO green, pre-commit verified clean locally. Would appreciate a `ready` label to run CI.",
