    "body": "@yewentao256 Re-ran the reproduction on the vLLM main branch as requested.\r\n\r\n- **main @ `4dcd10eb0`** (nightly wheel `0.22.1rc1.dev255+g4dcd10eb0`, RTX PRO 6000 / SM120): garbage outputs, log attached. Dynamo on this build also warns that `_C::hadacore_transform`'s output aliases its input and that this \"will become an error in PyTorch 2.12\".\r\n- **Same main commit + this PR's fix cherry-picked** (build `dev256+g1ea902a7c`, same GPU / checkpoint / command): all 5 prompts coherent, log attached. The only delta between the two runs is this PR's 3-line change.\r\n\r\nPR description updated (Reproduction / Test Plan / Test Result) with the exact commands and both logs.",
